    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A favorite of apprentices and students, this spell makes you look fully focused and attentive for the duration. Behind the illusion, you can doze off, think about something else, or simply let your mind wander.</p><p>A creature that takes the Search action to judge your state of mind sees through the act with a successful Wisdom (Insight) check against your spell save DC. A creature that discerns the illusion sees your true demeanor.</p>",
